# Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA) Notes

## What is HPA?

Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA) automatically scales the number of pods in Kubernetes based on metrics like:

- CPU usage
- Memory usage
- Requests/sec
- Queue length
- Kafka lag
- Custom Prometheus metrics

It works mainly with:

- Deployment
- StatefulSet
- ReplicaSet

---

# HPA Architecture

Pods
  ↓
Metrics Server / Prometheus Adapter
  ↓
Metrics API
  ↓
HPA Controller
  ↓
Deployment replica count updated
  ↓
Pods scaled up/down

