Core HPA Formula

DesiredReplicas = CurrentReplicas × (CurrentMetricValue / DesiredMetricValue)

Example

Current replicas = 4

Current CPU = 80%

Desired CPU = 40%

DesiredReplicas = 4 × (80 / 40)

DesiredReplicas = 8

So Kubernetes scales:
4 pods → 8 pods

CPU Utilization Formula

CPUUtilization = (ActualCPUUsage / RequestedCPU) × 100

Example:

Requested CPU = 200m

Actual usage = 100m

CPU Utilization = 100 / 200 × 100 = 50%

IMPORTANT:
HPA uses REQUESTS, not LIMITS.
